{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39155","headline":"又闻湖南荆渚相次陷没 · 韦庄","name":"又闻湖南荆渚相次陷没","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"几时闻唱凯旋歌，处处屯兵未倒戈。\n天子只凭红斾壮，将军空恃紫髯多。\n屍填汉水连荆阜，血染湘云接楚波。\n莫问流离南越事，战余空有旧山河。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦庄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39155.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39155","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}